{"id":"ne40815a75e","headline":"Iran war adds pressure to slowing U.S. economy","summary":"The war with Iran, now over five months old with no end in sight, is acting as a tax on the US economy. Energy costs are rising, inflation has accelerated, and military spending is running into tens of billions of dollars.","why":"The US economy is the world's largest and its inflation and rate path shape global asset prices, so an energy-driven inflation shock matters widely for investors.","category":"economy","event_type":"macro-data","importance":3,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Washington","country":"United States of America","lat":38.9,"lon":-77.04,"region":"na"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"TPR","url":"https://www.tpr.org/podcast/the-source/2026-08-10/iran-war-adds-pressure-to-slowing-u-s-economy"},"sources":[{"name":"TPR","url":"https://www.tpr.org/podcast/the-source/2026-08-10/iran-war-adds-pressure-to-slowing-u-s-economy"}],"published_at":"2026-08-10T17:38:58Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-11T22:35:51Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"ee968e942191cd9a","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-11T22:35:51Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-08-10T17:38:58Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-08-11T00:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"IR","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/parliament-government-building-6962982.jpg","alt":"parliament government building (illustration)","credit":"ValterM","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/parliament-architecture-building-6962982/"}}